esend the information if there is anything missing regarding the amount, etc.\nThank you in advance.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/oho_pc/status/1503678022725279745?s=46&t=QKY1SZPc4azy49-VDV9cRA", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@trpg_kanshiinu/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/301f49ce/uploads/origins/d6462a9a-180a-4375-98db-831dd07dc2c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2488aec6bc4ccaa8af7230cdc9ab0632", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/301f49ce/uploads/origins/d6462a9a-180a-4375-98db-831dd07dc2c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2488aec6bc4ccaa8af7230cdc9ab0632, https://si.imgix.net/301f49ce/uploads/origins/d6462a9a-180a-4375-98db-831dd07dc2c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ec0464e6213fa0beedb4a69d40e90395 2x, https://si.imgix.net/301f49ce/uploads/origins/d6462a9a-180a-4375-98db-831dd07dc2c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=356049ee35e51e54d9532af7d76d372b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "Dear Mr. Haramine\n\nI am a fan of your work.\nI always look forward to your wonderful illustrations.\nI am very sorry to contact you so suddenly, but I have a favor to ask you today.\nI would like to ask you to draw an illustration of Cecilia Kitty wearing a lovely outfit.\nI would be very happy if the proposed outfit is a bondage or bunny type outfit, as it would be very cute.\nI'll leave it up to you to decide if you want it to be sensitive or not!\n\nhttps://wowma.jp/item/508251284?aff_id=PLA510507&gclid=CjwKCAjwp9qZBhBkEiwAsYFsb3unCWom4L5Lnl48i4JPd5alLcWu-l9sAnmKF70YLSIeiaE6sY8 WRBoC3HUQAvD_BwE\nhttps://amzn.asia/d/hgVTOeq\nhttps://lovememore.kawaiishop.jp/items/44580544\nhttps://item.rakuten.co.jp/malymoon/2804/\n\nWe hope you will check back with us when you are available.\nBest regards!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@trpg_kanshiinu/wo